---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Portrait from '../components/Portrait.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
const challenges=['Sales forecasts are difficult to trust.','Different teams have different versions of the numbers.','CRM and reporting systems create more work than they should.','Important projects stall because nobody has time to lead them.','Teams spend too much time reacting and not enough time improving.'];
const focus=[['Better visibility',"Reliable forecasts, useful reporting, and performance measures that help leaders understand what's happening and make informed decisions."],['Better processes','Clearer sales processes, more effective use of existing tools, and operational practices that support the business instead of slowing it down.'],['Better execution','Help setting priorities, coordinating work across teams, and making sure important initiatives actually move forward.']];
---
<Layout title="Fractional Revenue Operations Leadership" description="Wade Olcott provides embedded, fractional Revenue Operations leadership for growing B2B companies. More than 20 years of experience at Visa and Cybersource.">
<section class="hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Fractional Revenue Operations Leadership</p><div class="grid md:grid-cols-[2.5fr_1fr] gap-8 md:gap-20"><div><h1>Part of your team.<br/><span class="text-[#58758b]">Invested in your success.</span></h1><div class="hero-copy"><p class="text-lg">Growing companies don't always need another full-time executive. Sometimes they need an experienced leader who can step in, understand the business, and help get things moving.</p><p>I work alongside founders and leadership teams to improve revenue visibility, strengthen sales operations, and tackle the operational challenges that come with growth.</p><p>With more than 20 years of experience, including VP-level roles at Visa and Cybersource, I've spent much of my career solving these problems from inside the business.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-7 items-center mt-8"><a class="button" href="/contact">Let's Talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/how-i-work">How I Work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><aside class="hero-aside"><p class="eyebrow">An experienced partner</p><span class="number">20+</span><p>years inside the business</p><div class="border-t border-[#cbd4d8] pt-5 mt-6"><p>VP-level leadership at<br/><strong class="text-navy font-medium">Visa &amp; Cybersource</strong></p><p class="mb-0">A small practice.<br/>A personal commitment.</p></div></aside></div></section>
<section class="section bg-[#eef1ee]"><div class="wrap grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-24"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / The challenge</p><h2>Growth has a way of exposing what's not working.</h2><p>As companies grow, so does the complexity behind the scenes. More people, more systems, more data, and more competing priorities.</p></div><div><ul class="challenge-list">{challenges.map(c=><li>{c}</li>)}</ul><p class="mt-7">These problems don't always require major investments or a complete overhaul. They do require someone who can see the bigger picture, identify what matters, and help the team address it.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">02 / What I bring to the team</p><h2 class="max-w-2xl">A practical approach to Revenue Operations.</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-9 mt-14">{focus.map(([title,body],i)=><article class="focus"><span class="index">0{i+1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section dark"><div class="wrap grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-24"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / How I work</p><h2>Not another consultant on the sidelines.</h2><a class="text-link" href="/how-i-work">Explore the approach <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div><p>I've spent most of my career working inside organizations, leading teams, solving problems, and being accountable for results.</p><p>That's how I prefer to work today.</p><p>Through RevLytics, I take on a small number of ongoing partnerships where I can become a genuine part of the team.</p><p>I participate in the conversations, help establish priorities, work alongside employees, and take responsibility for moving important work forward.</p><p>You get the benefit of experienced Revenue Operations leadership without needing to fill another full-time executive position.</p><p class="serif text-2xl border-t border-[#496172] pt-7 mt-7 text-white!">I'm there to help do the work, not just tell you what needs to be done.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap grid md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] gap-12 md:gap-24"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / Experience that translates</p><h2>I've worked through these challenges before.</h2><p>Over more than two decades at Authorize.Net, Cybersource, and Visa, I've worked across sales strategy, revenue operations, analytics, and sales technology.</p><p>My responsibilities have included leading global operations teams, building forecasting and planning processes, improving sales reporting, and helping organizations get more value from their systems and data.</p><p>I've worked closely with sales, finance, technology, and executive leadership—and understand how difficult it can be to keep everyone aligned as a business grows.</p><a class="text-link" href="/experience">More about my experience →</a></div><div class="border-l border-[#cbd4d8] pl-8 md:pl-12 flex flex-col justify-center gap-8"><div><span class="number">20+</span><p class="mb-0">years of experience</p></div><div><h3 class="mb-2">VP-level leadership</h3><p class="mb-0">Inside established organizations</p></div><div><h3 class="mb-2">Global perspective</h3><p class="mb-0">Revenue Operations experience</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section bg-[#eef1ee]"><div class="wrap grid md:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] gap-10 md:gap-24 items-center"><Portrait/><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / The person behind RevLytics</p><h2>Hi, I'm Wade.</h2><p class="text-lg">I started RevLytics to do the work I enjoy most: getting to know a business, working alongside its people, and helping make things work better.</p><p>After more than 20 years in sales operations and revenue leadership, I value practical progress and straightforward conversations. I like being close to the work and accountable to the people doing it.</p><p>RevLytics is intentionally small. I work with one or two companies so I can give each relationship the time and attention it deserves.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">A little more about me →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-24"><div><p class="eyebrow">06 / A good fit matters</p><h2>Who I work best with.</h2></div><div><p>RevLytics is designed for growing B2B companies that need stronger Revenue Operations leadership but aren't ready to hire someone full-time.</p><p>Typically, there's already a team doing good work. What may be missing is the experience, capacity, or leadership needed to bring everything together.</p><p>I work best with founders and executives who value straightforward communication, collaboration, and accountability.</p><p>I prefer ongoing working relationships where I can understand the business, contribute consistently, and help the team make measurable progress.</p></div></div></section><ContactCTA/>
</Layout>
